sequenceDiagram

    Actor User as Registered User
    participant UI as Client UI
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant AS as Auth Service
    participant TS as ThreadService
    participant DB as Database

    activate UI

    opt user needs new access token

    UI->>API: 1. GET /api/users/refresh_tok/{refreshTok}
    activate API
    API->>AS: 2. getAccessToken(refresh_token)
    activate AS
    AS-->>API: 3. AccessToken
    deactivate AS
    API-->>UI: 4. 200 OK (AccessToken)
    deactivate API


    end

    opt user first opens thread list in a session

    User->>UI: 5. requestThreadList()
    UI->>API: 6. GET /api/threads/get_all_threads
    activate API
    API->>TS: 7. getAllThreads()
    activate TS
    TS->>DB: 8. SELECT * FROM threads
    activate DB
    DB-->>TS: 9. {thread rows}
    deactivate DB
    TS-->>API: 10. Thread Array
    deactivate TS
    API-->>UI: 11. 200 OK (ThreadList)
    deactivate API
    UI-->>User: 12. sendThreadList(threads)

    end

    User->>UI: 13. requestThreadMessages(thread_id)
    UI->>API: 14. GET /api/threads/{id}/messages
    activate API
    API->>TS: 15. getThreadMessages(thread_id)
    activate TS
    TS->>DB: 16. SELECT * FROM messages WHERE thread_id = thread_id
    activate DB
    DB-->>TS: 17. {message rows}
    deactivate DB
    TS-->>API: 18. Message Array
    deactivate TS
    API-->>UI: 19. 200 OK (MessageList)
    deactivate API

    loop for each message received
    UI-->>User: 20. Display Message
    end

    deactivate UI
